{"ticker":{"symbol":"199730.KQ","name":"바이오인프라","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1319.0,"change_pct":-0.07762237762237767,"market_cap":6416099840.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.22744503411675512,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":5420.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Yongin-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.bioinfrakorea.co.kr","business_summary":"BioInfra Co., Ltd. operates as a contract research organization for phase 1 clinical trials. The company provides clinical, which undertakes clinical trials for new drug development approval (Phase I-III) and late clinical trials; immunoassay, which performs pharmacokinetic, toxicokinetic, and biomarker analysis of polymer biopharmaceuticals; and testing and inspection, which provides finished drug product quality inspection, comparative dissolution testing, and long-term stability testing. It also specializes in bioequivalence testing of generic drugs, phase 1 clinical trials for new and improved drugs; and sample analysis services for new drug substances. The company was founded in 2007 and is based in Yongin-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)바이오인프라는 1상 임상시험을 위한 위탁연구기관으로 운영되고 있습니다. 신약개발 승인(1~3상) 및 후기임상시험을 위한 임상시험을 수행하는 임상을 제공합니다. 고분자 바이오의약품의 약동학, 독성동태학, 바이오마커 분석을 수행하는 면역분석법; 완제의약품 품질검사, 비교용출시험, 장기안정성시험 등을 실시하는 시험검사 업무를 수행하고 있습니다. 또한 제네릭의약품의 생물학적동등성시험, 신약 및 개량신약의 1상 임상시험, 신규 원료의약품에 대한 시료분석 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2007년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 용인시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":35427367530.0,"operating_income":6360195970.0,"net_income":6237198990.0,"eps":1511.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":30128735340.0,"operating_income":1305211970.0,"net_income":2001611060.0,"eps":426.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":23833208620.0,"